<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>This macro is designed for the M92 pistol. It only works properly when the player is crouched and not straffing, this macro also works with the following attachments : Holosight + Ironsight. This macro runs best at FOV90 and SENSE0.7. This macro is designed to make you look like a pro player and reduces the chance of you being banned.</Description>
